{
  "episode": 21,
  "source": "assets/video/ep21.mp4",
  "model": "base",
  "duration": 294.4755,
  "segments": [
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.0,
      "text": "Journey to the West, Chapter 21, The Monsters Friend."
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 14.0,
      "end": 17.0,
      "text": "Wukong stood before Gwanyin."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 17.0,
      "end": 22.0,
      "text": "He was telling the Bodhisattva everything that had happened at the monastery."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 22.0,
      "end": 26.0,
      "text": "Then a bear spirit called the Black Wind King stole the robe."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 26.0,
      "end": 28.0,
      "text": "The monkey went on."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 28.0,
      "end": 31.0,
      "text": "I demanded he give it back."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 31.0,
      "end": 36.0,
      "text": "We fought until the bear spirit said it was lunchtime and hid in his cave."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 36.0,
      "end": 41.0,
      "text": "I kicked the door and yelled insults at him for more than an hour."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 41.0,
      "end": 44.0,
      "text": "But he wouldn't come out."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 44.0,
      "end": 47.0,
      "text": "You must help me."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 47.0,
      "end": 50.0,
      "text": "Gwanyin sighed."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 50.0,
      "end": 54.0,
      "text": "The Tang monk should not have shown that robe to the priest."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 54.0,
      "end": 55.0,
      "text": "She said."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 55.0,
      "end": 58.0,
      "text": "The robe is a Buddhist treasure."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 58.0,
      "end": 62.0,
      "text": "When other people see it, they will want it."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 62.0,
      "end": 68.0,
      "text": "And as that head priest tried to do, they might harm the Tang monk."
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 68.0,
      "end": 69.0,
      "text": "I agree."
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 69.0,
      "end": 71.0,
      "text": "Said Wukong."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 71.0,
      "end": 75.0,
      "text": "I've told the Tang monk many times not to do dumb things."
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 75.0,
      "end": 77.0,
      "text": "But still he..."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 77.0,
      "end": 80.0,
      "text": "And you should have put out that fire."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 80.0,
      "end": 83.0,
      "text": "Gwanyin said interrupting Wukong."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 84.0,
      "end": 87.0,
      "text": "What you did was terrible."
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 87.0,
      "end": 90.0,
      "text": "Gwukong looked at the ground."
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 90.0,
      "end": 92.0,
      "text": "He kicked a pebble."
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 92.0,
      "end": 93.0,
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 93.0,
      "end": 95.0,
      "text": "He mumbled."
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 95.0,
      "end": 98.0,
      "text": "I'll help you get back the robe."
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 98.0,
      "end": 99.0,
      "text": "Said Gwanyin."
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 99.0,
      "end": 101.0,
      "text": "Let's go."
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 101.0,
      "end": 106.0,
      "text": "Gwukong and Gwanyin soared over the ocean."
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 106.0,
      "end": 110.0,
      "text": "Soon they landed on the mountain."
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 110.0,
      "end": 113.0,
      "text": "Where is the Black Wind King's cave?"
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 113.0,
      "end": 115.0,
      "text": "Asked Gwanyin."
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 115.0,
      "end": 116.0,
      "text": "It's close."
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 116.0,
      "end": 117.0,
      "text": "Said Wukong."
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 117.0,
      "end": 119.0,
      "text": "We should sneak up to it."
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 119.0,
      "end": 122.0,
      "text": "They heard footsteps coming closer."
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 122.0,
      "end": 127.0,
      "text": "Wukong and Gwanyin hid as a Taoist priest walked along the path."
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 127.0,
      "end": 129.0,
      "text": "The priest was holding a tray."
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 129.0,
      "end": 132.0,
      "text": "A bright purple pill sat on the tray."
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 132.0,
      "end": 135.0,
      "text": "The priest was talking to himself."
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 135.0,
      "end": 137.0,
      "text": "This is an exciting day."
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 137.0,
      "end": 138.0,
      "text": "He said."
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 138.0,
      "end": 142.0,
      "text": "The Black Wind King has a new robe that is a Buddhist treasure."
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 142.0,
      "end": 145.0,
      "text": "And I hope he likes the pill I made for him."
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 145.0,
      "end": 148.0,
      "text": "It will make him live forever."
    }
  ]
}
